              "heading": "Less window juggling. More forward motion.",
              "body": "A place for the project you are deep in, the experiment on the side, and the conversation you will want to find again.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "title": "See the work together.",
                  "description": "Keep terminals and conversations side by side. Give a project its own group, and every agent a clear place in it."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Find that conversation.",
                  "description": "Search your sessions and retained transcripts. Get back to the decision, the useful answer, or the detail you remember."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Clear the desk. Keep the work.",
                  "description": "Archive sessions when you are done. Unarchive them when you need them again, with their retained history close at hand."
                }
              ]
            }
          }
